('GNSH-SLV-004','GI-001','GENSHIN','Akun Starter AR10 Single / Double Bintang 5 (B5 Limited)','Akun Starter Adventure Rank 10 fresh, memiliki 1-2 Karakter Bintang 5 Limited spesifik (misal: Arlecchino, Neuvillette, Furina, Raiden Shogun). Bithday Unset.','GAME_ACCOUNT_TRANSFER','1. Pembeli wajib langsung bind Email pribadi di website account.hoyoverse.com.
